	(30, 1, '2024-05-22 08:50:17', '2024-05-22 08:50:17', '{\n    "widget_text[1]": {\n        "value": {\n            "encoded_serialized_instance": "",\n            "title": "",\n            "is_widget_customizer_js_value": true,\n            "instance_hash_key": "6e98a2dffe885a527f09bda7a0088437",\n            "raw_instance": {\n                "title": "",\n                "text": "<a href=\\"\\"><img id=\\"tp-seal\\" src=\\"http://localhost/wp-content/themes/gwt-wordpress-26.0.0/images/transparency-seal-160x160.png\\" alt=\\"transparency seal logo\\" title=\\"Transparency Seal\\"></a>\\n<p>The DA-CBC</p>",\n                "filter": false,\n                "visual": false\n            }\n        },\n        "type": "option",\n        "user_id": 1,\n        "date_modified_gmt": "2024-05-22 08:50:17"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6a23dec0-ba7b-4adf-9417-7a4f613dfaa7', '', '', '2024-05-22 08:50:17', '2024-05-22 08:50:17', '', 0, 'http://localhost/6a23dec0-ba7b-4adf-9417-7a4f613dfaa7/', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0),
	(31, 1, '2024-05-22 08:51:44', '2024-05-22 08:51:44', '{\n    "widget_text[1]": {\n        "value": {\n            "encoded_serialized_instance": "",\n            "title": "",\n            "is_widget_customizer_js_value": true,\n            "instance_hash_key": "a272e06942bdefa4b167310845e76aa4",\n            "raw_instance": {\n                "title": "",\n                "text": "<a href=\\"\\"><img id=\\"tp-seal\\" src=\\"http://localhost/wp-content/themes/gwt-wordpress-26.0.0/images/transparency-seal-160x160.png\\" alt=\\"transparency seal logo\\" title=\\"Transparency Seal\\"></a>\\n<p>The Crop Biotechnology Center (CBC) is dedicated to advancing agricultural innovation through cutting-edge biotechnological research and development. Our mission is to enhance crop productivity, resilience, and sustainability, ensuring food security and improving the livelihoods of farmers. At CBC, we leverage the latest scientific advancements to create solutions for the challenges faced by agriculture today and in the future. </p>",\n                "filter": false,\n                "visual": false\n            }\n        },\n        "type": "option",\n        "user_id": 1,\n        "date_modified_gmt": "2024-05-22 08:51:44"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'b234e4a8-2275-420b-94ee-e296e5ae2739', '', '', '2024-05-22 08:51:44', '2024-05-22 08:51:44', '', 0, 'http://localhost/?p=31', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0),
	(32, 1, '2024-05-22 08:52:52', '2024-05-22 08:52:52', '{\n    "widget_text[1]": {\n        "value": {\n            "encoded_serialized_instance": "",\n            "title": "",\n            "is_widget_customizer_js_value": true,\n            "instance_hash_key": "8b2b0251adf3acc7db7a6fe07b7228e1",\n            "raw_instance": {\n                "title": "",\n                "text": "<a href=\\"\\"><img id=\\"tp-seal\\" src=\\"http://localhost/wp-content/themes/gwt-wordpress-26.0.0/images/transparency-seal-160x160.png\\" alt=\\"transparency seal logo\\" title=\\"Transparency Seal\\"></a>\\n<p>The Crop Biotechnology Center (CBC) supports the Philippines\' Transparency Seal mandate by ensuring openness in our research. We enhance crop productivity and sustainability, providing accessible information to improve food security and farmers\' livelihoods.</p>",\n                "filter": false,\n                "visual": false\n            }\n        },\n        "type": "option",\n        "user_id": 1,\n        "date_modified_gmt": "2024-05-22 08:52:52"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3cf280e1-3262-48c5-a72b-8d8d8734c73f', '', '', '2024-05-22 08:52:52', '2024-05-22 08:52:52', '', 0, 'http://localhost/3cf280e1-3262-48c5-a72b-8d8d8734c73f/', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0),
	(33, 1, '2024-05-22 08:56:15', '2024-05-22 08:56:15', '{\n    "widget_text[1]": {\n        "value": {\n            "encoded_serialized_instance": "",\n            "title": "",\n            "is_widget_customizer_js_value": true,\n            "instance_hash_key": "c71b5294b95d67f8d8b263a10cae4ead",\n            "raw_instance": {\n                "title": "",\n                "text": "<a href=\\"\\"><img id=\\"tp-seal\\" src=\\"http://localhost/wp-content/themes/gwt-wordpress-26.0.0/images/transparency-seal-160x160.png\\" alt=\\"transparency seal logo\\" title=\\"Transparency Seal\\"></a>\\n<p>The DA-CBC supports the Philippines\' Transparency Seal mandate by ensuring openness in our research. We enhance crop productivity and sustainability, providing accessible information to improve food security and farmers\' livelihoods.</p>",\n                "filter": false,\n                "visual": false\n            }\n        },\n        "type": "option",\n        "user_id": 1,\n        "date_modified_gmt": "2024-05-22 08:54:06"\n    },\n    "widget_text[2]": {\n        "value": {\n            "encoded_serialized_instance": "",\n            "title": "",\n            "is_widget_customizer_js_value": true,\n            "instance_hash_key": "08336e4dacb8f06182fd0fe52850dffc",\n            "raw_instance": {\n                "title": "",\n                "text": "<a href=\\"https://www.foi.gov.ph/\\"><img id=\\"foi-logo\\" src=\\"http://localhost/wp-content/themes/gwt-wordpress-26.0.0/images/foi-logo-160x160.png\\" alt=\\"freedom of infromation logo\\" title=\\"Freedom of Information\\"></a>\\n<p>Embracing the principles of the Freedom of Information (FOI) bill, we\'re committed to openness and accountability in our research endeavors. Explore how we uphold transparency, providing accessible information to empower stakeholders and advance agricultural innovation. Join us as we pave the way for a more informed and engaged agricultural community.</p>",\n                "filter": f