	(168, 1, '2024-05-28 09:35:42', '2024-05-28 01:35:42', '{\n    "widget_widget_carousel_slider[3]": {\n        "value": {\n            "encoded_serialized_instance": "YToyOntzOjU6InRpdGxlIjtzOjA6IiI7czoxMToiY2Fyb3VzZWxfaWQiO2k6MTY1O30=",\n            "title": "",\n            "is_widget_customizer_js_value": true,\n            "instance_hash_key": "6d7842bfd3dff47cc10c1962caa1a192"\n        },\n        "type": "option",\n        "user_id": 1,\n        "date_modified_gmt": "2024-05-28 01:35:42"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'a2eb3806-815f-4add-af55-b56bc8bfab03', '', '', '2024-05-28 09:35:42', '2024-05-28 01:35:42', '', 0, 'http://localhost/a2eb3806-815f-4add-af55-b56bc8bfab03/', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0),
	(170, 1, '2024-05-28 09:42:32', '2024-05-28 01:42:32', '', 'DSC_0261', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'dsc_0261', '', '', '2024-05-28 09:42:32', '2024-05-28 01:42:32', '', 18, 'http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/DSC_0261.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
	(171, 1, '2024-05-28 09:44:09', '2024-05-28 01:44:09', '<!-- wp:image {"id":170,"sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/DSC_0261-1024x683.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-170"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Eggplant</strong> is one of the world’s most important vegetables and a staple in some South and Southeast Asian countries. In the Philippines, eggplant or talong is the leading vegetable crop in terms of volume (248,000 metric tons) and area of production (14,000 hectares) based on the 2022 Philippine Statistics Authority report. Eggplant farming also offers huge income potential for resource-poor farmers in many provinces in the country.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For years, eggplant&nbsp;<strong>production</strong>&nbsp;in the Philippines suffered huge<strong>&nbsp;losses of up to 73%</strong>&nbsp;annually due to its most devastating insect pest, the&nbsp;<strong>eggplant fruit and shoot borer (EFSB)</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The female moths of EFSB usually deposit eggs on the underside of the leaves which then develop into larvae. These larvae feed on soft leaf tissues and tunnels through emerging shoots and immature fruits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To prevent severe losses due to EFSB infestation and damage, farmers spray their eggplant crops with cocktails of chemical insecticides at least 4 times a week, or up to 80 times per cropping season. According to studies, eggplant farmers spend 20-40% of the total production cost for chemical insecticides alone. This practice is costly, unsustainable, and harmful to farmers and their communities, consumers, and the environment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Eggplant Production in the Philippines', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '18-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-28 09:44:09', '2024-05-28 01:44:09', '', 18, 'http://localhost/?p=171', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
	(173, 1, '2024-05-28 09:55:09', '2024-05-28 01:55:09', '<!-- wp:image {"id":11,"sizeSlug":"full","className":"is-style-default"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-style-default"><img src="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/EDITED-IMG_0198-edited-scaled.jpg" alt="DA-CBC Front Image of the building" class="wp-image-11"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>Crop Biotechnology Center (CBC) </strong>is one of three biotechnology centers under the <strong>Department of Agriculture </strong>(DA). It serves as a catalyst in the development of and utilization of modern biotechnologies for agriculture. It rationalizes and implements the research, development, and extension agenda of the DA-Biotech Program. It also provides biotechnology capacity-building services to a network of R4D institution in the use of modern crop biotechnologies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>DA-CBC</strong> focuses on applying advanced technologies that contribute to the improvement in performance, yield, and quality of important commodities, such as rice, corn, coconut, and high value crops, such as mango, garlic, onion, eggplant, tomato, cotton, rubber, cassava, sweet potato, yam, cacao, papaya, banana, and abaca.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"textAlign":"center"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>R4D AREAS</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Genetics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Genetic Engineering and Gene Editing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tissue Culture</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Microbial Biotechnology</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Diagnostics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Bioinformatics and Computational Biology</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Natural Products, Natural Ingredients, and Value-Adding</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"textAlign":"center"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>Laboratories</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Molecular Genetics</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Functional genomic approaches to accelerate crop breeding and production</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Construction of detailed, high-resolution QTL maps and physical maps for map-based cloing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Genetic Transformation . </strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use of genetic manipulation to improve traits of interest<strong> </strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Development of genetically modified (GM) and non-GM organisms, alterations to gene sequences, and gene knock-outs (RNAi)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"textAlign":"center"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>Tissue Culture</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Aseptic propagation of plant parts in a highly controlled environment </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Creation of genetic variability for crop improvement</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"textAlign":"center"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>Systems Biology (\'omics\')</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Systems biology approaches combining metabolomics with proteomics and/or transcriptomics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Experimental strategies to characterize ribonucleic acid-protein complexes/interactions</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"textAlign":"center"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>Microbial Biotechnology</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use of plant-growth-promoting microorganisms (PGPM) as biofertilizers to enhance plant and soil health and biopesticide to control invasive plants and insects </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"textAlign":"center"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>Bioinformatics and Computational Biology</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use of bioinformatics tools and high-performance computing systems and various computing support services to transform complex data into information useful to scientists </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"textAlign":"center"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Molecular Diagnostic</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Development of molecular tests, including biochemical, electrochemical, optical, and imaging-based, to diagnose diseases or other pathological conditions </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"textAlign":"center"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>TRAINING/ CONFERENCE VENUE</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Plenary Hall (Capacity:600 pax) </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Multipurpose Hall (Сарасіtу: 300 рах) </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Training Rooms (Capacity: 300 pax)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->', 'What is DA-CBC?', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '152-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-28 09:55:09', '2024-05-28 01:55:09', '', 152, 'http://localhost/?p=173', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
