	(367, 1, '2024-05-28 15:23:03', '2024-05-28 07:23:03', '<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion">Facilities</button>\n<div class="panel">\n  <ul>\n<li><div class="wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center is-image-fill"><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">\n<p>Welcome to <b>The Plenary Hall</b>, a meticulously designed space tailored to meet your audio-visual needs with utmost professionalism. Our hall boasts a fully equipped Audio-Visual room featuring cutting-edge technology, including a large LED wall and seating capacity for up to 600 individuals. Ensuring your comfort is paramount, our facility is fully air-conditioned, providing a conducive environment for seamless presentations and events. With systematic lighting and a dedicated control room, we guarantee a flawless experience, meticulously managed to exceed your expectations. Trust in our commitment to professionalism as we deliver unparalleled service in every aspect of your event at the Plenary Hall.</p>\n</div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media" style="background-image:url(http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-1024x683.jpg);background-position:50% 50%"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="683" src="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-1024x683.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-213 size-full" srcset="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view