/li>\n<li><div class="wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center is-image-fill"><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">\n<p>Welcome to our <b>Training Rooms</b>, where learning meets comfort and convenience! With three spacious rooms, each accommodating up to 300 participants, we provide the ideal environment for your training sessions, workshops, seminars, and more. Our well-equipped facilities ensure that your training events run smoothly, allowing you to focus on delivering valuable content. Whether you\'re hosting a small group or a larger gathering, our Training Rooms are designed to meet your needs effectively and efficiently.</p>\n</div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media" style="background-image:url(http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Office-1st-Flr-1024x461.jpg);background-position:50% 50%"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="461" src="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Office-1st-Flr-1024x461.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-215 size-full" srcset="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Office-1st-Flr-1024x461.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Office-1st-Flr-300x135.jpg 300w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Office-1st-Flr-768x346.jpg 768w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Office-1st-Flr-1536x691.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Office-1st-Flr-2048x922.jpg 2048w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Office-1st-Flr-500x225.jpg 500w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"></figure></div></li>\n</ul>\n<div class="text-center sm:p-5 p-1 font-bold">Book a reservation now!</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->', 'Services', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '123-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-28 16:03:27', '2024-05-28 08:03:27', '', 123